rd bosses  and the final boss in his second and  final form sir sweet is a calamity  there's only so many times i can say  ridiculous insane or brutal  i'm running out of synonyms he's tough  to hit the main mechanic of the game  stunning bosses to hurt them doesn't  work on him and you'll basically be  required to memorize every single aspect  of this boss fight without messing up  once in the three minute time limit in  order to actually beat him it is stupid  it is ridiculous and that is why it's on  this list  so this one is kind of a bonus entry  because as much as i enjoy shoot em ups  bullet hells in games like ikaruga this  one is more so just widely notorious and  a game that i haven't played and that is  the final boss of mushihimesama futari i  honestly don't think there's too much to  say about this one  i'm just gonna show you footage  [Music]  my list is limited to games i've played  or games that are notorious so i'm  asking you are there any bosses i should  have listed i almost put sigma from mega  man x the final boss of illusion of gaia  and sephiroth of kingdom hearts but they  just didn't quite make my cut let me  know what you think and if you'd like to  see a similar video about difficult  levels or unfair bosses and i'll see you  guys next time  peace  you
 

